DESCRIPTION:Topic\n\n:\n\nRetirement Planning – Never too early Never too
	 late (Hong Kong)\n\nSynopsis\n\n:\n\nEveryone wishes a retirement with qu
	ality of life or even early retired! When & How should i do for planning m
	y excellent retirement life? What should I do now?\n\nThis webinar will sh
	are you what you have to take into consideration for your retirement plann
	ing\, and also some products/practices about retirement tools in HK market
	 along with the available solutions/products in DBS with preferential excl
	usive staff offer!\n\nSpeakers\n\n:\n\nDBS Speaker:\n\nEdward Hui\, Vice P
	resident\n\nBancassurance Team\n\n \n\nManulife Speakers: \n\nRon Tsang\, 
	Senior Manager\n\nManulife Business Academy\nHK Bancassurance\n\nCandy Cha
	n\, Senior Manager\n\nPartnership Distribution\n\n \n\n\n\n_______________
	__________________________________________________________________________
	_____________________\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining via a laptop or m
	obile device through the application:\n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex M
	eeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=mf40c3ee18038c002d3224d1
	c62fd473d> \n2. Use a headset for a better experience\n*Visit here <https:
	//dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?mar
	ket=Singapore&category=Communication> to find out more about Webex \n\nMee
	ting password: dyDk9nYbt54 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are join
	ing via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the 
	"Call" icon\n2. Dial 25187153931@dbs.webex.com <mailto:25187153931@dbs.web
	ex.com>  into the search bar and press "Call" \n3. If you are the host\, e
	nter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Click here to see how to retrieve you
	r Host KEY <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared%20Documents
	/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2F
	sites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%
	5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2F
	sites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If y
	ou are joining via a laptop through the Web browser: \nFor external partie
	s who do not wish to download the application \n1. Click on this hyperlink
	: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=mf40c3ee18038c0
	02d3224d1c62fd473d> \n2. Click on ‘Cancel button’ if a popup ‘Open W
	ebex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Join from your browser’ \n4. Enter your 
	Name and Email Address and join the meeting \n\nClick here <https://help.w
	ebex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a-Webex-Meeting#id_135013> to find ou
	t more\n\nOption 4 – If you are dialling in via phone (audio only):\n*To
	ll charges / Long distance charges may apply.\nNote if you are the host\, 
	please use either Option 1 or 2 to start the meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-
	6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nHong Kong +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2
	B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-
	22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hyderabad +91-40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91
	-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2-5594-0839 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0
	839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2518 715 3931#\nGlobal call-in numbe
	rs <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php> \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed 
	help? Contact Webex Support Team! <mailto:webexsupport@dbs.com> \n\n \n\n
